OL,3,GNEWSAAnne opens history centre at war
OL,4,Acemetery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Princess Royal has opened a new
OL,7,Fhistory centre at a Staffordshire
OL,8,Fcemetery dedicated to German and
OL,9,FAustrian war dead, aimed at helping
OL,10,Fvisitors understand the history and
OL,11,Freconciliation between Britain and
OL,12,FGermany.
OL,14,FPrincess Anne attended a commemorative
OL,15,Fevent at Cannock Chase German Military
OL,16,FCemetery on Thursday, where
OL,17,Frepresentatives from both the UK and
OL,18,FGermany gathered for the official
OL,19,Fopening.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
