OL,3,GNEWSAAnne opens history centre at war
OL,4,Acemetery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new centre features a bilingual
OL,7,Fexhibition and workshop facilities
OL,8,Fexplaining German-British history and
OL,9,Fthe reconciliation that followed World
OL,10,FWar Two.
OL,12,FThe cemetery contains the graves of
OL,13,Fnearly 5,000 people from the two World
OL,14,FWars.
